  "title": "Volta Labs at AACR 2025: Showcasing Advanced Targeted Sequencing Solutions for Cancer Research",
  "summary": "The Volta Labs team is excited to announce our participation in the American Association of Cancer Research (AACR) Annual Meeting 2025, taking place April 25-30 in Chicago, Illinois. As the critical driver of progress against cancer, AACR brings together scientists, clinicians, and healthcare professionals to share groundbreaking advancements in cancer science and medicine.",
